*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
# Real uploaded documents and local fixtures. .gcloudignore REPLACES .gitignore rather than
# adding to it, so these were in the build context despite being gitignored. The agent image
# never COPYied ingest/ so nothing reached a layer; the parser image does, which would have
# baked users' own PDFs into a published container image.
ingest/uploads/
ingest/sample/
tests/
eval/
scripts/
data/filings.jsonl
.github/
